      "id": "story-ticker/mega-booster-mobility",
      "source_text": "戦場へ素早く移動。大サービス品、メガブースター。",
      "source_text_sha256": "7a0edcbaef762ff708812ccf7c923acb0a0a0a7f9f25f985f30d5497ee568afc",
      "translation": "快速奔赴戰場，特價強化推進器。",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/mega-booster"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "d8bb82a609eec04f85e224f24ce82e69bd9d5f31bc85504b0478bc33971d4bde",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/wanted-factory",
      "source_text": "お尋ね者ファクトリー。発見者はトーブ家に連絡を。",
      "source_text_sha256": "539b17bfef80298ba744a6a3ee5cb5c64b6c5f4c1036522cbdbcf941f7fe8b49",
      "translation": "工廠遭通緝，發現者請聯繫托布家。",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "faction/factory"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "4b469c0871144a471cc9d293baaf9eaf6be854904b9fc2fe29403dc3a98c69dc",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/combat-manual-premium-sale",
      "source_text": "小隊員のあなたは必読。戦技マニュアル、絶賛発売中。",
      "source_text_sha256": "8a366e367976c789e3d00cb929eee109eb63cb777baa9289c1a6503f983422f3",
      "translation": "小隊員必讀，戰技手冊熱賣中。",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/combat-manual"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "263a9fefc2a2d225f24391da55eca80b5b169feef7e831973674c6828a38d7df",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/event-flea-market",
      "source_text": "イベントと連動のフリマ開催中！　感応ヘルメット、大安売り！",
      "source_text_sha256": "cb4d2e9de5bc1e3994f749a164b439adbed0b0b2a46fd717ef0ecb4421167c18",
      "translation": "配合活動，跳蚤市場開辦中！感應頭盔大減價！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/attuned-helmet"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "31631376fc3160cd616bee4e6c8114969736b2c0f04d69b0ca7923d80a735817",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/daily-flea-market",
      "source_text": "本日もフリマ開催中！　ハイブリッドアーマー、大放出！",
      "source_text_sha256": "4d4251eab2f2912946de5b06e237f3541027dadd86ad2c342c1c8d8333858aa3",
      "translation": "今日跳蚤市場繼續開辦！混合式裝甲大放送！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/hybrid-armor"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "41461b34638ee5bf4b8e8a8e97c6fed8b5a2fe4b005396dd61dff4901dbea4fc",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/mega-booster-dash",
      "source_text": "戦場へダッシュ！　メガブースター大放出！",
      "source_text_sha256": "f332e08119f8db0fc6cacb2bed93f5a18bd28aa7f9836e8ed03467c4ab30a7b5",
      "translation": "衝向戰場！強化推進器大放送！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/mega-booster"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "f9d7450f36c9d4cef7aa4f2ca3b28795ea96d3705e563442e12a198081e45970",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/battlefield-relief-market",
      "source_text": "戦地救済マーケット。物資不足につき売却大歓迎。",
      "source_text_sha256": "05c46763fa9b747011d3c0a09a9b312317e5e756c808fb2e05ec7ba95d7af4f3",
      "translation": "戰區救援市場，物資短缺，歡迎出售。",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "system/sell"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "06dedbe154fee7845851ea987846bf9b3ae2d513685cd13d1987c33aa7bc01e6",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/tin-goldfish-buyback",
      "source_text": "求む、ブリキの金魚！　高価買取中！",
      "source_text_sha256": "4b122bc6069a7d46db12a336ff9e64201857b9adee1662d03df83f966eaf8ee5",
      "translation": "求購鐵皮金魚！高價收購中！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/tin-goldfish"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "6d620e3b9ec5ed950a807936543885438d4b1133f65d01d82af77e2289de6fc5",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/thruster-module",
      "source_text": "宇宙戦闘の必需品、スラスターモジュール！　絶賛発売中！",
      "source_text_sha256": "e07ac8d87b4a795b6a6e010939b7553a57eea4fc205b52f0ee5954566e4b28d7",
      "translation": "宇宙作戰必需品噴射模組！熱賣中！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/thruster-module"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "b53dae7056e14b492324fddff02d6f56f7c301fd64bee84d5e55acd46bc9d07c",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/alien-defeat-a-adapter",
      "source_text": "異星人撃退記念！　Ａ−アダプター、大幅値下げ！",
      "source_text_sha256": "e2b94a103781558ae1ee0c3838381c37b4500573a288d5676b77512787bc6b64",
      "translation": "紀念擊退外星人！A適配器大幅降價！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/a-adapter"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "669059921a18d369da03ed1d1d1719a59a63793923347ae5a9dbd38eb8d6b469",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/donkey-bread-taste",
      "source_text": "味は保証付き！　ドンキーのパン、大安売り！",
      "source_text_sha256": "f49312d5d8223410c685d4358264902a2464f4cf620d063e273c70459f1e31ec",
      "translation": "味道有保證！唐吉的麵包大減價！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/donkey-bread"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "c48f2c5bdb0ced044eba5ecc9d8cfb5225d5b76ef09e2048a8f71ea94c019258",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/emaan-selection",
      "source_text": "エマーンならではの品揃え。ドンキーのパンも販売中。",
      "source_text_sha256": "d815bcb473ca6198b2e0dbb707f80c57c95a639ac756845df3cf6774f864002d",
      "translation": "埃曼特色商品齊全，唐吉的麵包也有出售。",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "organization/emaan",
        "part/donkey-bread"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "13067140430f014db7e8786b41a9d18fdb4a94afeda60715d19db5d0692375ab",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/solar-panel",
      "source_text": "エネルギー不足は、これで解消。ソーラーパネル、販売中。",
      "source_text_sha256": "eae827449afcbfa03f4398749edf569d0add84123cfb47a518b1bc36ba032003",
      "translation": "能源不足就用它解決，太陽能板出售中。",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/solar-panel"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "abe952aeeabb91e2dbbf73ec9d99a28794bc01ada733d7c89dde47febba6c9ea",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/storewide-clearance",
      "source_text": "大バーゲン！　全品赤字覚悟の大放出！",
      "source_text_sha256": "a6ccc4651ea91de3fb62f4df6c30a8c4c3e93c2a390bceca22f54fb926d150b2",
      "translation": "大甩賣！全場虧本大放送！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "system/sell"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "cf8603483ffb680f40945da65705f62711b770197e60880c2f6644e339267337",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/diana-counter-mobile-suit",
      "source_text": "ディアナ・カウンターの特殊モビルスーツ入荷。ここだけの大放出。",
      "source_text_sha256": "50beb1556891ff4964c6cfed40b7432be97769393d68ef17b1f5914d02821133",
      "translation": "迪亞娜回歸軍的特殊MS到貨，僅此一處大放送。",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "faction/diana-counter",
        "system/mobile-suit"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "752e5ee1a37800cadb1e82407ed3cfb6fdbdbac978a55eb8e5a312d742b4ba81",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/a-adapter-clearance",
      "source_text": "あらゆる局面で最大限の戦闘力を。Ａ−アダプター、大放出。",
      "source_text_sha256": "2087046bdf7e6e61020902bf1b5209366c97befcb3742759410860db6c799386",
      "translation": "應對各種局面，發揮最大戰力。A適配器大放送。",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/a-adapter"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "0822bc0d3fc600ac307253f1498a9e4907b1cf38b7cc8bfa6fd30acfda45d3e4",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/final-clearance",
      "source_text": "最終大売出し！　全品大サービス！",
      "source_text_sha256": "5c4168c8b80f59fdd9e3d5234ee453301cd2d45f637c202dae394119b3e7b6f8",
      "translation": "最終大甩賣！全場大優惠！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "system/sell"
      ],
      "zh_hans_sha256": "6df5e707f80cf29caf7f064cbfa8bb168a94831e2d1d522b43cbc5115d40597e",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "story-ticker/heavens-base-thruster-sale",
      "source_text": "ヘブンズベースから大放出！　スラスターモジュール、大幅値下げ！　",
      "source_text_sha256": "8aceecaa3ddea960ae622fdf6d8fd1e39421f5024974acca543b7648b3a668cd",
      "translation": "天堂之門庫存大放送！噴射模組大特惠！",
      "editorial_status": "reviewed",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "part/thruster-module"
      ],
      "notes": "用户于 2026-10-05 采用“大放送／大特惠”的广告表达。天堂基地沿用 story/108/dialogue/01.01/0000 等剧情译名；喷射模组按已批准零件术语。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "581eaf5b57fbedf240d9be3680175717fcbb3ed17b236dfe6edd69be50ab863b",
      "zh_hant_status": "edited"
    }
  ]
}
